\[\begin{array}{l} {\left|\begin{array}{ccccc}P_{1}&1&0&\ldots&0\\ P_{2}&P_{1}&2&&\cdots&.\\ P_{3}&P_{2}&P_{1}&&\cdots&.\\ .&.&.&&\cdots&.\\ .&.&.&&\cdots&0\\ .&.&.&&\cdots&n{-}1\\ P_{n}&P_{n{-}1}&P_{n{-}2}&&\ldots&P_{1}\\ \end{array}\right.}\\ \end{array}\]

summed over \(a_{1}+2a_{2}+\) . . .. +\(na_{n}=n\); e.g. if \(P_{k}=\Sigma^{r}_{j-i}z^{x}_{j}\) for \(k=1,\,2\), . . ., \(n\) then the determinant and sum equal \(n!2x_{i}x_{i}\dots x_{n}\), the latter sum denoting the \(n\)-th elementary symmetric function of \(x_{1},x_{2},\,\ldots\,,\,x_{r}\).

#### 24.1.3 Stirling Numbers of the First Kind Definitions

A. \((-1)^{n-n}S^{(m)}_{n}\) is the number of permutations of \(n\) symbols which have exactly \(m\) cycles. B. Generating functions

\[x(x{-}1)\,\ldots\,(x{-}n{+}1){=}\mathop{\sum}\limits_{n=0}^{n} S^{(m)}_{n}x^{n}\]

\[\{\ln\,(1{+}x)\}^{n}{=}m!\mathop{\sum}\limits_{n=m}^{\infty} S^{(m)}_{n}\mathop{\pi}\limits_{n!}^{n} \qquad|x|{<}1\]

C. Closed form (see closed form for \(\mbox{ \boldmath$S$}^{(m)}_{n}\))

\[S^{(m)}_{n}{=}\mathop{\sum}\limits_{k=0}^{n-m} \stackrel{{ n{-}1+k}}{{n-}m+k}\stackrel{{ 2n{-}m}}{{-}m-k}\not{S}^{(m)}_{n{-}m+k}\]

## II Relations

* Recurrences \[S^{(m)}_{n+1}{=}S^{(n-1)}_{n}{-}nS^{(m)}_{n}\qquad\qquad\qquad n{\geq}m{\geq}1\] \[\stackrel{{ m}}{{r}}S^{(m)}_{n}{=}\mathop{\sum} \limits_{k=m-r}^{\infty}\stackrel{{ n}}{{r}}\stackrel{{ N(r)}}{{R}}S^{(r)}_{n-k}S^{(m-r)}_{k}\quad\qquad n{\geq}m{\geq}r\]
* Checks \[\mathop{\sum}\limits_{n=1}^{n} S^{(m)}_{n}{=}0\qquad\qquad\qquad n{>}1\] \[\mathop{\sum}\limits_{n=0}^{n} \,(-1)^{n-n}S^{(m)}_{n}{=}n!\] \[\mathop{\sum}\limits_{k=m}^{n} S^{(m+1)}_{n}{n}^{-}{=}S^{(m)}_{n}\]
* Numerical analysis \[\frac{d^{m}}{dx^{m}}f(x){=}\,m!\mathop{\sum}\limits_{n=m}^{\infty} \frac{S^{(m)}_{n}}{n!}\,\Delta^{q}f(x)\] if convergent.

